# Code owners for cc-switch
#
# Merging to `main` needs two approving reviews from maintainers (branch
# protection), and any maintainer may then press merge. Branch protection also
# has "Require review from Code Owners" enabled, so a PR touching a path below
# additionally needs the owner's approval.
#
# `.github/` stays locked because it holds this file, the branch-protection-
# facing CI gate, and the release / signing workflows: without the lock, a PR
# could rewrite the rules that govern its own merge.
